27:T8e7,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a private driver cost in Riyadh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no fixed price list — the fare depends on the car you choose and how many hours you keep it. Send the date, start time, hours and rough stops on WhatsApp and we reply with one fixed fare for the whole block, usually within 1–2 hours. No meter runs, and there is no surge at busy times."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is hourly hire worth it for a single trip across Riyadh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Usually not. Hourly hire is sold as a block of hours, so for one journey — RUH to your hotel, or your hotel to a venue — a single transfer is simpler. Ask for an hourly quote once your day has three or more stops, or meetings whose finish time you cannot predict."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the driver wait while I'm in meetings in KAFD or Olaya?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, waiting is what the hours pay for. Large KAFD towers and Olaya malls often have more than one entrance, so give us the building name when you book and we agree the pickup point in advance. Message the driver when you are coming down."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a driver for several days in a row?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. For a conference week or a visiting delegation, send the dates and the daily start and finish times and we quote every day together. Whether the same driver covers each day is confirmed with the quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can companies be invoiced for a daily driver in Riyadh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company. Email the company name, the dates and the number of cars, and the quote comes back in writing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which cars can I book with a driver in Riyadh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Executive sedans such as the Genesis G80, luxury sedans including the Mercedes S-Class and BMW 7 Series, full-size SUVs like the GMC Yukon XL, and the Mercedes V-Class for groups — all through our partner network. The exact car for your date is confirmed when we quote."}}]}1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C]","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/riyadh/private-driver#service\",\"name\":\"Private Driver in Riyadh — Hourly & Full-Day Chauffeur\",\"serviceType\":\"Hourly & full-day chauffeur hire\",\"description\":\"Hire a private driver in Riyadh by the hour or full day — meetings across KAFD, Olaya and the Diplomatic Quarter, shopping or events. Fare agreed first.\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/riyadh/private-driver\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Taxi Saudi Arabia\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Riyadh\"},\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\",\"Arabic\"]}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/riyadh/private-driver#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/riyadh/private-driver\",\"speakable\":{\"@type\":\"SpeakableSpecification\",\"cssSelector\":[\"h1\",\"#speakable-summary\"]}}"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$27"}}]],"$L28","$L29","$L2a"]}]
